1
00:00:00,691 --> 00:00:04,361
(Raj:)Boy, you cannot catch a break,
can you?

2
00:00:06,864 --> 00:00:09,284
(Mrs Cooper:)-Here you go, Shelly.
-Thanks, Mom.

3
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:11,330
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

4
00:00:12,203 --> 00:00:15,993
(Mrs Cooper:)Hold your horses, young man.
Here in Texas, we pray before we eat.

5
00:00:16,165 --> 00:00:17,205
Oh, Mom.

6
00:00:17,375 --> 00:00:20,875
(Mrs Cooper:)This is not California,
land of the heathen.

7
00:00:21,837 --> 00:00:23,337
Give me.

8
00:00:27,218 --> 00:00:30,388
(Mrs Cooper:)By his hand we are all--

9
00:00:30,596 --> 00:00:31,636
(Sheldon:)Fed.

10
00:00:31,806 --> 00:00:35,266
(Mrs Cooper:)-Give us, Lord, our daily--
-Bread.

11
00:00:35,434 --> 00:00:37,724
(Mrs Cooper:)-Please know that we are truly--
-Grateful.

12
00:00:37,895 --> 00:00:40,395
(Mrs Cooper:)-For every cup and every--
-Plateful.

13
00:00:40,564 --> 00:00:42,444
(Mrs Cooper:)Amen.

14
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:46,950
(Mrs Cooper:)Now, that wasn't so hard, was it?

15
00:00:47,488 --> 00:00:51,788
(Sheldon:)My objection was based
on considerations other than difficulty.

16
00:00:51,951 --> 00:00:54,621
(Mrs Cooper:)Whatever. Jesus still loves you.

17
00:00:56,998 --> 00:00:59,708
(Sheldon:)Thank you for carving a smiley face
in my sandwich.

